00:04:22.363 --> 00:04:27.000
Come and pull the Engine from the atmospheric fire!

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:32.500
I received the telemetry, I'm reading the line

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:38.954
Get here to the debris field, we're running out of time!

00:04:41.475 --> 00:04:43.677
You read the line.

00:04:47.199 --> 00:04:49.800
You made the time.

00:04:49.800 --> 00:04:52.863
The cavalry is here.

00:04:52.863 --> 00:05:03.000
[Outro — Victorious Guitar Chords & Stable Electronic Hum]
